  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.1: keeps values other agents (for example a customer's own hosting startup) set in ASPNETCORE_HOSTINGSTARTUPASSEMBLIES, DOTNET_ADDITIONAL_DEPS and DOTNET_SHARED_STORE; Marketplace installs add any missing one of these App Settings (see the README). v1.1.0: .NET Core 3.1 support; virtual-app path prefix in captured URIs. See RELEASE_NOTES.md for complete details.",
